		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15950&amp;sid=2ad893443a04e6cf26d76733e357770d#15950"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Sep 26, 2002 11:40 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15950&amp;sid=2ad893443a04e6cf26d76733e357770d"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lanturias doesn't look at Arialana, instead gazing at his shoes. His face is slightly red as he speaks &quot;Yes I know. I am ashamed of what I did to Jesent. It was wrong, even if I was upset, then the way I handled my anger was wrong. I guess I don't really know how to handle anger...other than keeping it bottled up inside. Yes, I know thats not healthy.&quot; Lanturias sighs and walks around, looking down at his hands. &quot;I should probably go apologize to Jesent.&quot; he mutters, frowning.  &quot;Would you like to come back with me, or do you have other plans? 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Master Lanturias Kyerme
<br />
Coercer of <a href="http://theshadowcongress.com/" target="_blank" class="postlink">Shadow Congress</a></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
